  "limits": "The Android System WebView of the device with that adb serial, in a fresh process per row; no per-process CPU (the WebView has no process list). A fresh page per row; pass 1 is cold (nothing drawn yet), later passes replay the same bytes. Per-glyph figures divide the cold excess by the distinct (style, character) pairs of the stream, a count of what a glyph cache must draw, not of what the addon actually cached."
}
